    "body": "Constraining `transferControlToOffscreen()` and its output seems like a reasonable solution to me. Having a weak reference to an element across process boundaries seems very sketchy.\r\n\r\nWe should probably require `OffscreenCanvas` with a placeholder `canvas` element to stay within the same agent cluster, just like `SharedArrayBuffer`.",
