    "created_at": "2026-10-12T08:19:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-12T08:19:40Z",
    "body": "I created two draft PRs with tests here, one assuming we do want a same-agent-cluster limitation on placeholder canvas and one where we don't:\n\n- https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/63467\n- https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/63540\n\nBased on this I think we can add the limitation.\n\nIt also seems that Chrome already has an agent cluster limitation for various features such as `VideoFrame`. Why wasn't it added here? Does anyone know?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
