    "created_at": "2026-10-15T18:46:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-15T18:46:54Z",
    "body": "I don't have much background on Chromium's agent cluster limiting decisions, but if I were to guess it's purely historical: `OffscreenCanvas` transfer predates the `IsLockedToAgentCluster` mechanism and likely never got updated.  Maybe @junov has more info.\n\nFWIW Chromium handles this quite poorly: we assume that a placeholder-linked `OffscreenCanvas` stays in the same renderer process, and attempting cross-process drawing (like your [wpt#63540](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/63540)) triggers a browser-side bad Mojo message that kills the receiving renderer process.  Constraining should address that.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
