    "created_at": "2026-10-16T15:24:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-16T15:24:59Z",
    "body": "I was not aware of IsLockedToAgentCluster prior to reading this. In theory we shouldn't need to impose such a limitation on OffscreenCanvas, but the practical reality is that the current implementation in Chromium is limited to not transferring OffscreenCanvas across process boundaries and the limitation is not handled gracefully. If there's not enough demand or motivation to fix this properly, then we should probably at least make it fail gracefully, and perhaps codify the limitation in the spec.",
